      "data": {
        "markdown": "## Prior plan\n\nThe original semantic-zoom task graph records the fixed-level implementation and its historical decisions. This follow-up replaces the fixed View-count assumption; keep its other completed work intact.\n\n`github://twilite-zone/public/tasks/semantic-zoom/root.node`",
